{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/2a0cadd38996cf2622371d058c801c6a.avif?t=1772225743\" width=840 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.poster.avif?t=1772225743\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.webm?t=1772225743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/0e08df00be5592a42abce597df3f46ce.mp4?t=1772225743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>The Ghouls are coming for you!</u></strong><strong>\u00a0 Play like your life is at stake and defend yourself from these terrifying and scary creatures, from farty strong zombies, to deadly mafia skeletons that will put you down, survive 3 waves to beat the game!! With increasing difficulty and Cursed waves with new challenges  </strong>   <br><strong>  </strong>  <br><strong> \u00bfCan you survive this insanity?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PUNCH THE GHOULS BRUTALLY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.poster.avif?t=1772225743\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343580/extras/e0ccd204b53fda27452e3836ef6298b3.webm?t=1772225743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v